<Comment id="163d2c38-210a-11ef-b9b9-a32a51ceba6c">
<body>
<val>Property naming:
model_name.change_type.id{data}

Change type could be:
property
transaction

In the 'property' type the ID is the property name, and there is no data
In the 'transaction' type the ID is the transaction ID, and the data is the list of the names of the properties that changed.</val>
</body>
